<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 56 0 R
/E (A: Quick wins are useful, but without a roadmap they often create multiple versions of truth, manual reconciliation, and one-off integrations. A roadmap ensures each initiative strengthens the same pit-to-port operating logic, so pilots scale safely and benefits compound rather than reset at every rollout.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
